  "releaseNotes": "v7.23 => v8.0\n- updated to NPOI-2.7.6;\n- (!) _GetRegisteredStyle() fixed;\n- from _GetRegisteredStyle() removed reuseUnusedStyle argument;\n\nv7.22 => v7.23\n- updated to NPOI-2.7.4;\n- _GetImages() upgraded;\n\nv7.6 => v7.7\n- _CopyCell() fixed;\n- CopyCellMode.CopyImage added;\n- _NewRange() => sheet._GetRange();\n- SetAlteredStyles() changed;\n- Range.SetAlteredStyles() added;\n- Range.GetCells() added;\n- EasyStyleCache added;\n\nv7.5 => v7.6\n- SafeSave() merged into Save();\n- Table.Column.HeaderStyle added;\n- AddRow() merged into WriteRow();\n- Table.Get renamed to Table.GetMode;\n\nv6 => v7\n- Sheet removed from Cliver.Excel;\n- Cliver.Excel stripped off almost all methods;\n- many extension methods were removed, changed, added;\n- Excel.StyleCache added;\n- Excel.Table upgrated;",
